<description>
<![CDATA[Se você utiliza o Freeform para criar quadros compartilhados com os seus colegas de trabalho e amigos, já&#8230;]]>
</description>
<content:encoded>
<![CDATA[
    <p>Se você utiliza o <strong><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/sobre/freeform/">Freeform</a></strong> para criar quadros compartilhados com os seus colegas de trabalho e amigos, já deve saber que é muito simples personalizá-los, de forma a adicionar informações importantes para trabalhar ou estudar.</p><p>Para lhe ajudar a encontrar alguma informação importante, é possível fazer buscas em textos escritos à mão, notas adesivas, caixas de texto, formas e nomes de arquivos em todos os quadros ou dentro de um específico.</p><p>Veja como fazer isso! 😉</p><div class="cnvs-block-posts cnvs-block-posts-1764178181658 cnvs-block-posts-layout-horizontal-type-1" data-layout="horizontal-type-1" data-min-height=""><div class="cs-posts-area" data-posts-area=""><div class="cs-posts-area__outer"><div class="cs-posts-area__main cs-block-posts-layout-horizontal-type-1 cs-posts-area__image-width-one-third"><article class="post-919093 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-apple category-dicas category-mac category-tutoriais tag-desenhos tag-dica tag-dicas tag-escrita tag-fotos tag-freeform tag-ios-16-2 tag-ipad tag-ipados-16-2 tag-iphone tag-mac tag-macos-ventura-13-1 tag-quadros tag-tutoriais tag-tutorial tag-videos cs-entry cs-video-wrap"><div class="cs-entry__outer"><div class="cs-entry__inner cs-entry__thumbnail cs-entry__overlay cs-overlay-ratio cs-ratio-landscape-21-10"><div class="cs-overlay-background cs-overlay-transparent"><img decoding="async" width="3840" height="2743" src="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform.jpeg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="Aplicativo Freeform no iPadOS 16" srcset="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform.jpeg 3840w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-600x429.jpeg 600w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-1260x900.jpeg 1260w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-300x214.jpeg 300w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-1536x1097.jpeg 1536w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-2048x1463.jpeg 2048w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-380x271.jpeg 380w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-800x571.jpeg 800w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-1160x829.jpeg 1160w" sizes="(max-width: 3840px) 100vw, 3840px" data-attachment-id="910025" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2022/10/24/ipados-16-1-e-lancado-com-stage-manager-app-tempo-e-mais/apple-ipados-16-freeform/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform.jpeg" data-orig-size="3840,2743" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Aplicativo Freeform no iPadOS 16" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2022/10/ipados-16-is-available-today/&lt;/p&gt;
" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-600x429.jpeg" data-large-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Apple-iPadOS-16-Freeform-1260x900.jpeg">                    </div><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2022/12/14/o-que-e-e-como-usar-o-freeform-iphone-ipad-e-mac/" class="cs-overlay-link"></a></div><div class="cs-entry__inner cs-entry__content "><div class="cs-entry__content-inner"><h2 class="cs-entry__title "><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2022/12/14/o-que-e-e-como-usar-o-freeform-iphone-ipad-e-mac/">O que é e como usar o Freeform [iPhone, iPad e Mac]</a></h2><div class="cs-entry__post-meta"><div class="cs-meta-author"><a class="cs-meta-author-inner url fn n" href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/author/pedro/" title="View all posts by Pedro Henrique Nunes"><span class="cs-author">Pedro Henrique Nunes</span></a></div><div class="cs-meta-date">14/12/2022 • 07:30</div></div>
