</div>
</div><h2 class="wp-block-heading is-style-cnvs-heading-numbered">Para fazer uma busca dentro de um quadro pelo iPhone/iPad</h2><p>Abra o Freeform e toque em cima do quadro desejado. Em seguida, selecione o botão com três pontinhos (no canto superior direito) e em “Buscar” para abrir o campo de pesquisa e digitar o que procura.</p><div class="wp-block-image"><figure data-wp-context="{&quot;imageId&quot;:&quot;693077c68e20f&quot;}" data-wp-interactive="core/image" class="aligncenter size-large wp-lightbox-container"><img decoding="async" width="1260" height="826" data-attachment-id="1121178" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/12/03/como-fazer-uma-busca-dentro-de-um-ou-em-todos-os-quadros-no-freeform-iphone-ipad-e-mac/26-busca-freeform/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-busca-freeform.png" data-orig-size="4530,2970" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="busca no freeform" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-busca-freeform.png" data-large-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-busca-freeform-1260x826.png" data-wp-class--hide="state.isContentHidden" data-wp-class--show="state.isContentVisible" data-wp-init="callbacks.setButtonStyles" data-wp-on-async--click="actions.showLightbox" data-wp-on-async--load="callbacks.setButtonStyles" data-wp-on-async-window--resize="callbacks.setButtonStyles" src="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-busca-freeform-1260x826.png" alt="" class="wp-ima