<content:encoded>
<![CDATA[
    <p>O <strong><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/sobre/freeform/">Freeform</a></strong> já está presente nos sistemas operacionais da Apple há alguns anos. Com ele, você pode criar quadros com as mais diferentes ferramentas, como fotos, vídeos, documentos e outros itens — e compartilhá-los com os seus colegas para um fluxo de trabalho mais colaborativo.</p><p>Por aqui, <a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2024/06/09/como-copiar-e-colar-estilos-de-formatacao-em-quadros-no-freeform-iphone-e-ipad/">nós já ensinamos</a> como você pode facilmente copiar e colar os estilos de formatação em quadros do aplicativo. Neste artigo, mostraremos como também é possível salvar um estilo como Estilo de Inserção — caso goste de um deles.</p><p>Veja como fazer! 😉</p><div class="cnvs-block-posts cnvs-block-posts-1764168533563 cnvs-block-posts-layout-horizontal-type-1" data-layout="horizontal-type-1" data-min-height=""><div class="cs-posts-area" data-posts-area=""><div class="cs-posts-area__outer"><div class="cs-posts-area__main cs-block-posts-layout-horizontal-type-1 cs-posts-area__image-width-one-third"><article class="post-1016885 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-apple category-dicas category-software category-tutoriais tag-dica tag-dicas tag-estilo tag-estilo-de-formatacao tag-estilos tag-estilos-de-formatacao tag-freeform tag-ipad tag-iphone tag-quadro tag-quadro-do-freeform tag-tutoriais tag-tutorial cs-entry cs-video-wrap"><div class="cs-entry__outer"><div class="cs-entry__inner cs-entry__thumbnail cs-entry__overlay cs-overlay-ratio cs-ratio-landscape-21-10"><div class="cs-overlay-background cs-overlay-transparent"><img decoding="async" width="4096" height="3072" src="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="App Freeform no iPhone em cima de um Mac" srcset="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac.jpg 4096w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-600x450.jpg 600w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-1260x945.jpg 1260w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-300x225.jpg 300w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-380x285.jpg 380w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-550x413.jpg 550w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-800x600.jpg 800w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-1160x870.jpg 1160w" sizes="(max-width: 4096px) 100vw, 4096px" data-attachment-id="1017918" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2024/06/09/como-copiar-e-colar-estilos-de-formatacao-em-quadros-no-freeform-iphone-e-ipad/westbangalindia-february202023applefreeform-4/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac.jpg" data-orig-size="4096,3072" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Shutterstock&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;Copyright (c) 2023 sdx15\/Shutterstock.  No use without permission.&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;West,Bangal,,India,-,February,20,,2023,:,Apple,Freeform&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" data-image-title="App Freeform no iPhone em cima de um Mac" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;https://www.shutterstock.com/pt/image-photo/west-bangal-india-february-20-2023-2264733585&lt;/p&gt;
