" data-medium-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-600x450.jpg" data-large-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/08-freeform-iphone-mac-1260x945.jpg">                    </div><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2024/06/09/como-copiar-e-colar-estilos-de-formatacao-em-quadros-no-freeform-iphone-e-ipad/" class="cs-overlay-link"></a></div><div class="cs-entry__inner cs-entry__content "><div class="cs-entry__content-inner"><h2 class="cs-entry__title "><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2024/06/09/como-copiar-e-colar-estilos-de-formatacao-em-quadros-no-freeform-iphone-e-ipad/">Como copiar e colar estilos de formatação em quadros no Freeform [iPhone e iPad]</a></h2><div class="cs-entry__post-meta"><div class="cs-meta-author"><a class="cs-meta-author-inner url fn n" href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/author/pedro/" title="View all posts by Pedro Henrique Nunes"><span class="cs-author">Pedro Henrique Nunes</span></a></div><div class="cs-meta-date">09/06/2024 • 13:00</div></div>
</div>

</div><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2024/06/09/como-copiar-e-colar-estilos-de-formatacao-em-quadros-no-freeform-iphone-e-ipad/" class="cs-overlay-link"></a></div></article>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Como salvar um Estilo de Inserção no Freeform pelo iPhone/iPad</h2><p>Com um quadro aberto, toque na caixa de texto ou em outro item, vá até os três pontinhos e em “Estilo”. Escolha, então, <strong>“Salvar como Estilo de Inserção”</strong>.</p><div class="wp-block-image"><figure data-wp-context="{&quot;imageId&quot;:&quot;693077c69258a&quot;}" data-wp-interactive="core/image" class="aligncenter size-large wp-lightbox-container"><img decoding="async" width="1260" height="826" data-attachment-id="1121148" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/12/03/como-salvar-um-estilo-de-insercao-no-freeform-iphone-ipad-e-mac/26-estilo-insercao-freeform/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-estilo-insercao-freeform.png" data-orig-size="4530,2970" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="estilo de inserção no Freeform" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-estilo-insercao-freeform.png" data-large-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-estilo-insercao-freeform-1260x826.png" data-wp-class--hide="state.isContentHidden" data-wp-class--show="state.isContentVisible" data-wp-init="callbacks.setButtonStyles" data-wp-on-async--click="actions.showLightbox" data-wp-on-async--load="callbacks.setButtonStyles" data-wp-on-async-window--resize="callbacks.setButtonStyles" src="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26-estilo-insercao-freeform-1260x826.png" alt="" class="wp-image-1121148" sr