    </div>
    </div><p>Jogo de cores.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Aplicativos</h2><div class="itunes-live-tile-wrapper" data-props="{&quot;loja&quot;:&quot;br&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;1498504358&quot;,&quot;preco&quot;:&quot;24.90&quot;,&quot;screenshots&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;nota&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;&quot;}"><div class="itunes-live-tile-skeleton"><div class="skeleton-appicon"></div><div class="skeleton-appdetails"><div class="skeleton-title"></div><div class="skeleton-developer"></div></div><div class="skeleton-appstore"><div class="skeleton-price"></div><div class="skeleton-ctabutton"></div></div>
